{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    {{ icon("status-review", 56) }}
    <p class="tag">Specialised Service</p>
    <h1>Unsure About Your Immigration Status?</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">A confidential first step, before you approach the Bureau of Immigration yourself.</p>

    <p>If you are uncertain about the validity of your stay, your visa status, your extensions, or your immigration records in the Philippines, you can request a confidential preliminary assessment before personally attending a Bureau of Immigration office.</p>

    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviewing the information and passport details you provide</li>
      <li>Explaining what your situation means and what options are available to you</li>
      <li>Assisting with the relevant immigration transaction, where the applicable procedure allows representation or document processing on your behalf</li>
      <li>Providing specific instructions if an original travel document needs to be submitted, handled or returned</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>
        <h3>Share your situation</h3>
        <p>Tell us what you know about your status and provide the passport information we request.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Assessment</h3>
        <p>We review the available information and explain what it means for your circumstances.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Next steps</h3>
        <p>We explain the appropriate course of action and assist with the relevant transaction where we are able to.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Ongoing support</h3>
        <p>If an original document is required, we provide specific instructions for its submission, handling and return.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="context-note">
      <p>Important information: Immigration outcomes and processing requirements are determined by the relevant Philippine authorities. Our role is to assess the information available, explain the applicable process and provide assistance within the scope permitted for your particular circumstances.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>Get Clarity on Your Status</h2>
      <p>Share your situation confidentially and we will help you understand where you stand.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?service=status-review">Request a Status Review</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
